WEBVTT

00:00:27.940 --> 00:00:31.569
when our ancestors
first invented agriculture

00:00:31.569 --> 00:00:33.279
in that part of the world,

00:00:33.279 --> 00:00:36.532
that it set in motion
a chain of consequences

00:00:36.574 --> 00:00:40.995
that would shape our modern world
in a particular direction,

00:00:40.995 --> 00:00:43.498
on a particular course.

00:00:43.915 --> 00:00:46.209
By farming wheat,

00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:51.547
our ancestors supposedly developed
new attachments to the land they lived on.

00:00:51.589 --> 00:00:53.674
Private property was invented.

00:00:53.716 --> 00:00:56.427
And with that, the need to defend it.

00:00:56.761 --> 00:01:02.100
Along with new opportunities
for some people to accumulate surpluses,